cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this book, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Electrical Energy and Machines (Book 5 — The Electrical Energy & Machines Core)"
abstract: >-
  An open textbook on electrical energy conversion, electromechanical systems,
  power generation and delivery, and modern energy technologies: magnetic
  circuits, transformers, electrical machines and drives, generation and
  storage, power-system analysis, transmission, distribution, protection,
  high-voltage engineering, power quality, smart grids, electrical safety and
  design. 8 parts, 30 chapters and 174 computed figures, written in Markdown
  and LaTeX, with a typeset PDF and an MCP server.
authors:
  - given-names: "Golam Kuadir Khan"
    family-names: "Prince"
